If you want to fight them, here are some tips that you can use...

1) Don't carry any gold on you.  If they hit you while you are holding
gold, then they will teleport.

2) Get lots of missile weapons (i.e. daggers).  They probably run
faster than you, and trying to melee them all to death might get
frustrating.


P.S. If you are standing on gold, they have a small chance of swiping
the gold from under your feet, which also causes them to teleport.
They don't do that very often, so don't go out of your way to avoid
standing on gold.



